.SS "bool SystemEx\&.Threading\&.ThreadEx\&.Abandon ()"

.PP
Aborts the active invoke context\&. If the invoke-state bit is set, the context is terminated immediately through checkEndContext using abort semantics\&. 
.br
 All queued messages are discarded, the invoke-state bit is cleared, the commit window timer is stopped and reset, and the context mutex is released\&.

.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
\fRtrue\fP if an active invoke context was aborted; 
.br
 \fRfalse\fP if no invoke context was active\&. 
.RE
.PP

